#
# rocksdb.consistent_snapshot_ddl with rocksdb_two_write_queues=OFF.
#
# The snapshot-age check of PS-11627 takes the sequence number published by a
# DDL statement from a fresh snapshot, because with two_write_queues=ON (the
# default) the last allocated sequence can run ahead of the published one.
# This runs the same scenarios with a single write queue, under each write
# policy, and expects the same results.
#
--source suite/rocksdb/t/consistent_snapshot_ddl.test
